#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to find answers to questions or problems you encounter while using IBM "
"Quantum Platform or Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr ""
"Wie du Antworten auf Fragen oder Probleme findest, die beim Verwenden von "
"IBM Quantum Platform oder Qiskit Runtime auftreten"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Hilfe und Support"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Support {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Hilfe mit IBM Quantum Platform und Qiskit erhalten {#get-help-with-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"Sonderprogramme und Open Plan (ausgenommen Trial-Konten):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your "
"account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) or a "
"Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Ensure you have "
"selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account"
" or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr ""
"Alle Support-Anfragen müssen über das [IBM Cloud&reg; Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) eingereicht werden."
" Je nach Kontotyp kannst du entweder einen Cloud-Fall (Thema: Qiskit "
"Runtime) oder ein technisches Problem (Thema: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit "
"Runtime) eröffnen. Stelle sicher, dass du im Konto-Umschalter das richtige "
"IBM Cloud-Konto (dein institutionelles Cloud-Konto oder ein beliebiges "
"Nicht-Trial-Konto) ausgewählt hast.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr ""
"Um alle deine offenen IBM Cloud-Fälle einzusehen oder einen neuen Fall zu "
"eröffnen, besuche das [IBM Cloud Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job "
"errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team "
"includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of "
"topics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wende dich bei allen technischen Anliegen an uns – ob Plattformprobleme, "
"Job-Fehler, Qiskit-Fragen oder allgemeine Fragen zum Quantencomputing. Unser"
" Team besteht aus Fachexperten, die dir in all diesen Bereichen helfen "
"können.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Community-Support:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit"
" Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large "
"community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such"
" as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-"
"ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hast du ein Trial-Konto oder suchst du nach anderen Support-Optionen? [Tritt"
" der Qiskit Slack-Community bei](https://qisk.it/join-slack), um Hilfe von "
"unserer großen Community aus Nutzerinnen, Nutzern und Experten zu erhalten. "
"In Slack findest du thematische Kanäle wie #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-"
"platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem und viele mehr.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also use [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for "
"support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-"
"related questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst auch [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) nutzen, "
"um von der breiteren Community Unterstützung zu Quantencomputing- und "
"Programmierfragen zu erhalten.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-"
"an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr ""
"Probleme beim Erstellen eines Kontos oder beim Einloggen? {#having-trouble-"
"creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first "
"check whether you have access to the [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Wenn du beim Erstellen eines IBM Cloud&reg;-Kontos einen Fehler "
"erhältst,** prüfe zunächst, ob du Zugriff auf das [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) in IBM Cloud "
"hast.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing "
"your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account "
"verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du Zugriff auf die Seite „Fall erstellen\" hast, wähle Konto "
"(Verwaltung deines Kontos und deiner Ressourcen) als Kategorie und "
"anschließend Kontoverifizierung als Unterthema aus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or "
"Billing Request](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du keinen Zugriff hast, öffne einen Fall auf der Seite [Konto "
"erstellen, Anmeldung oder Abrechnung anfragen](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your "
"country is on the [Personal use "
"availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-"
"getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following "
"options:\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du beim Erstellen eines Kontos einen Fehler erhältst und **dein Land in"
" der Liste der [Verfügbarkeit für private "
"Nutzung](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-"
"started#signup-personalaccts) aufgeführt ist,** erkunde die folgenden "
"Optionen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources "
"without an account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kannst [Dokumentation](/docs) und [Lernressourcen](/learning) ohne Konto "
"nutzen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic "
"institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access "
"account](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild "
"Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more "
"information).\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du Studentin, Student oder Lehrperson an einer akkreditierten "
"akademischen Einrichtung mit Abschlussrecht bist, kannst du ein [SkillsBuild"
" Technology Access-Konto](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) erstellen (weitere "
"Informationen findest du in den [SkillsBuild Technology Access "
"FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/)).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 "
"days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the"
" trial).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Erstelle ein Trial-Konto](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) für "
"30 Tage kostenlosen Zugang (beachte, dass du nach Ablauf des Testzeitraums "
"wahrscheinlich keinen Zugriff mehr hast).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to "
"complete in your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Wenn du die Meldung „Dieses Konto ist inaktiv\" siehst,** besuche die [IBM"
" Cloud-Dokumentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive), um den Grund und die Lösung zu erfahren, oder rufe [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) auf, um zu prüfen, ob du noch ausstehende "
"Aktionen in deinem Konto abschließen musst.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Hinweis\">\n"
"Wenn du der **Inhaber** eines Pay-As-You-Go- oder Subscription-Kontos bist, musst du ein IBM Cloud-Konto erstellen und Rechnungsdaten zur Verifizierung angeben.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email "
"invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to "
"gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du **eingeladen wurdest, einem Konto beizutreten**, akzeptiere einfach "
"die E-Mail-Einladung und folge den [angegebenen Schritten](/guides/cloud-"
"setup-invited), um Zugang zu erhalten, ohne Rechnungsdaten anzugeben.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days "
"without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must "
"provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User"
" will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can "
"choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Inhaber von Trial-Konten** können eine Open Plan-Instanz für 30 Tage ohne "
"Angabe von Rechnungsdaten erstellen. Nach Ablauf des Testzeitraums müssen "
"Nutzerinnen und Nutzer Rechnungsdaten angeben, um ihr Konto zu verifizieren "
"und weiterhin zu verwenden. Es werden *keine Kosten berechnet*, wenn sie "
"weiterhin den kostenlosen Open Plan nutzen, aber sie können zu diesem "
"Zeitpunkt auf andere kostenpflichtige Pläne upgraden.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Informationen zu IBM Cloud-Konten findest du auf der Seite [IBM Cloud-Konto-FAQ](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Open-Source-Support {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code "
"to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-"
"conduct), PDF license agreements for "
"[individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and "
"[corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-"
"strategy), and the "
"[contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) "
"and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) "
"guides.\n"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Informationen zur Mitarbeit am Qiskit-Code findest du in den [Open-"
"Source-Ressourcen](/guides/). Dort sind der [Verhaltenskodex](/guides/code-"
"of-conduct), PDF-Lizenzvereinbarungen für "
"[Einzelpersonen](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) "
"und [Unternehmen](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf), die [Versionsstrategie](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy) sowie"
" die Leitfäden für "
"[Mitwirkende](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) "
"und [Maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) "
"enthalten.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To report bugs, make feature requests, and see what's coming in future "
"releases, visit the individual GitHub repositories:\n"
msgstr ""
"Um Fehler zu melden, Feature-Anfragen zu stellen und zu sehen, was in "
"zukünftigen Releases geplant ist, besuche die jeweiligen GitHub-"
"Repositories:\n"

